{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"sd23c46b86dcbf901","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-305fb18b7ad6bab046e3","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"sd23c46b86dcbf901","text":"창을 든 왕이 악당이라는 건 진작 들었어. 오늘 난 누가 가장 강한지 그 녀석과 겨룰 거야, 징","speaker":"분노 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"분노 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["15589687314718519333"],"speakerHashCandidates":["2611393509569346327"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-5d869f63f2e77f308488","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"sd23c46b86dcbf901","text":"하지만 여기서 오래 기다렸는데도 그 녀석은 나타나지 않네. 내 위명에 겁먹은 걸까, 징?","speaker":"분노 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"분노 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["1248814819368585317"],"speakerHashCandidates":["2611393509569346327"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-cb99496e461fb1a51cf2","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"sd23c46b86dcbf901","text":"징… 저 사람은 창을 든 왕이 보낸 시종인가? 무서워, 징……","speaker":"분노 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"분노 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["14215283956281776118"],"speakerHashCandidates":["2611393509569346327"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"interaction-p15862","title":"상호작용 기록","page":"虫鸣秘闻•3.0","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-305fb18b7ad6bab046e3","rowId":"other-interaction-p15862-305fb18b7ad6bab046e3","missionId":"interaction-p15862","mission":"상호작용 기록","sceneId":"sd23c46b86dcbf901","scene":"분노 벌레","contextId":"wiki-context-d49ee7fa029abcc1d184b5d3","page":"虫鸣秘闻•3.0","revision":72039,"location":[1,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":["other-interaction-p15862-5d869f63f2e77f308488"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-5d869f63f2e77f308488","rowId":"other-interaction-p15862-5d869f63f2e77f308488","missi